@baseUrl = http://localhost:5253
@workoutId = 1

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Exercise library
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/training/exercises

### Starter routines
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/training/routines

### Journal
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workouts

### Create a session; use its returned ID as workoutId above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Upper body",
  "date": "2026-11-15"
}

### Log a set (use a fresh GUID for each genuinely new set)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workouts/{{workoutId}}/sets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "413ee0b8-9cc1-49af-8cf0-07b6e57bf660",
  "exerciseId": "bench-press",
  "unit": "Pounds",
  "barWeight": 45,
  "leftPlates": [45, 25, 10],
  "rightPlates": [45, 25, 10],
  "reps": 5,
  "rpe": 8,
  "kind": "Working"
}

### Complete a nonempty session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workouts/{{workoutId}}/complete

### Export original plate stacks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workouts/export.csv
